.TH POKE "1" "March 2025" "GNU poke 4.2-maint-35-gc5886-modified" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
poke \- The GNU extensible binary editor
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B poke
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... [\fI\,FILE\/\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Interactive editor for binary files.
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-load\fR=\fI\,FILE\/\fR
load the given pickle at startup
.TP
\fB\-L\fR FILE
load the given pickle and exit
.SS "Commanding poke from the command line:"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-command\fR=\fI\,CMD\/\fR
execute the given command
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-source\fR=\fI\,FILE\/\fR
execute commands from FILE
.SS "Styling text output:"
.HP
\fB\-\-color=\fR(yes|no|auto|html|test) emit styled output
.TP
\fB\-\-style\fR=\fI\,STYLE_FILE\/\fR
style file to use when styling
.TP
\fB\-\-style\-dark\fR
use default style for dark backgrounds
.TP
\fB\-\-style\-bright\fR
use default style for bright backgrounds
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-no\-init\-file\fR
do not load an init file
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-auto\-map\fR
disable auto\-map
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-hserver\fR
do not run the hyperlinks server
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-stdtypes\fR
do not define standard types
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
be as terse as possible
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
print a help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show version and exit
.PP
The following environment variables, if set, are used by poke:
.TP
POKE_LOAD_PATH
List of file paths separated
by colon characters (:) which
is prepended to the load_path
when poke starts
